Package: eiFactor5
Title: Totality of Circumstances Factor 5 Analysis Using Census ACS Data
Version: 1.0.0
Authors@R: c(
    person("Loren", "Collingwood", email = "lcollingwood@unm.edu",
           role = c("aut", "cre")),
    person("Rachel", "Carroll", role = "ctb"))
Description: Retrieves American Community Survey (ACS) data via the Census API
    and computes socioeconomic status (SES) indicators by racial/ethnic group for
    Voting Rights Act Section 2 totality of circumstances Factor 5 analysis.
    Supports comparisons across White, Black, Hispanic, AAPI, and Native American
    populations at national, state, county, tract, and congressional district
    levels. Provides publication-ready comparison tables with statistical
    significance testing, and bar/dot chart visualizations.
License: GPL-3
